                  }
                ],
                "value": "Associated with membranes of lysosomes, early and late endosomes (PubMed:11274176, PubMed:27582497, PubMed:27927196). Can translocate from the cytoplasm into the nucleus (PubMed:15793005). Detected at Schmidt-Lanterman incisures and in nodal regions of myelinating Schwann cells (By similarity)"
              }
